cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below (preferred-citation)."
title: "EditJumps: an independent replication of EvoFlows edit-flow sequence editing"
abstract: >-
  An independent replication of EvoFlows (arXiv 2603.11703), an edit-flow generative model over
  protein sequences that proposes insertions, deletions and substitutions on a template, built on
  Edit Flows (arXiv 2506.09018) over an ESM-2 trunk. Includes the corpus build, the trunk
  adaptation, the Section 4.2 baselines, and the evaluation harness the reported numbers come from.
